            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Before the new one: say the Bengali for to burn down, then the Bengali for an explosion."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: পৌঁছানো",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "পৌঁছানো — poũchhāno — \"to arrive; to reach\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "আমরা কত তাড়াতাড়ি পৌঁছাব, সেটা তোমার ওপর নির্ভর করে। āmrā kôtô tāṛātāṛi poũchhābô, seṭā tomār opôr nirbhôr kôre. How fast we get there is up to you."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past (he/she …): সেই দমকল পৌঁছাল, sei dômkôl poũchhālô."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "পৌঁছানো (poũchhāno) is filed in CDIAL 8716 under Sanskrit prabhūta, 'much, great', which lists Bengali paũchā, 'to arrive'; how the sense moved is not set out there. Past: পৌঁছাল, arrived."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for telling what happened."
            }
          ]
        },
