              "text": "সাইরেন — sāiren — \"a siren\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "সাইরেন শুনে সবাই রাস্তার পাশে দাঁড়াল। sāiren shune sôbāi rāstār pāshe dā̃ṛālô. When they heard the siren, everyone stood at the side of the road."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "সাইরেন (sāiren) is borrowed from English siren, the warning wail of a fire engine or an ambulance; English took the name from the Sirens of Greek legend."
            }
          ]
        },
